Third-party notice

This repository does NOT bundle any third-party model weights. The optional
`--neural` cross-check (`python/music_emotion/neural.py`) is written against the
architecture of `audeering/wav2small`, whose weights are published under
CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0 (non-commercial, share-alike). If you download those weights,
that separate licence governs them, not the MIT licence above. The default
analysis path does not use any neural model.
